{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>E trouxeram o Mishkan.</b> As cortinas de trabalho artisticamente tecido." "<b>O Ohel.</b> As cortinas de pêlos de cabra." "<b>E todos os seus utensílios.</b> Os do Mishkan — pois os colchetes, as tábuas, as barras, as colunas e as bases eram todos utensílios do Mishkán."], :book "exodus", :voice :sforno, :lang :pt, :chapter 39, :timestamp "2026-07-27T20:28:27.530235949Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}